y reporting for 1 year.","It reported $385.6m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 79.0% against the same quarter a year earlier.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($162.8m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 79.0% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $150.7m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2029118/000202911826000052/0002029118-26-000052-index.htm","accession":"0002029118-26-000052"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 4 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2029118/000202911826000052/0002029118-26-000052-index.htm","accession":"0002029118-26-000052"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $162.8m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2029118/000202911826000052/0002029118-26-000052-index.htm","accession":"0002029118-26-000052"},{"text":"Net cash of $61.5m against total assets of $2.1bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2029118/000202911826000052/0002029118-26-000052-index.htm","accession":"0002029118-26-000052"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 33.1% across 4 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2029118/000202911826000052/0002029118-26-000052-index.htm","accession":"0002029118-26-000052"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 15.9% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2029118/000202911826000052/0002029118-26-000052-index.htm","accession":"0002029118-26-000052"},{"text":"Only 7 quarters of reported history. There is no track record here to speak of, and a short series flatters whatever the recent trend happens to be.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002029118"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.3% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2029118/000202911826000077/0002029118-26-000077-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 40.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.4,"consecutive":2,"current":0.79,"current_display":"79.0%","threshold_display":"40.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 23.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.23,"consecutive":1,"current":0.159,"current_display":"15.9%","threshold_display":"23.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the business is likely to compound.","editable":true},{"id":"leverage_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Debt to equity rises above 1.00","metric":"debt_to_equity","comparison":"above","threshold":1.0,"consecutive":1,"current":0.064,"current_display":"0.06","threshold_display":"1